[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Return to Game Mode
Name[ru]=Вернуться в игровой режим
Comment=Switch to the Steam Game Mode session
Comment[ru]=Переключиться в сессию Steam (Game Mode)
Exec=/usr/local/bin/return-to-gamemode
# Hidden until steamos-manager is installed (wsgame install).
TryExec=steamosctl
Icon=steam
Categories=Game;
